  "description": "Erection of single storey rear extension.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed single storey rear wraparound extension, by reason of its excessive depth, height and massing along the shared boundary with No. 31, would result in an unduly dominant, overbearing and visually intrusive form of development which would give rise to an unacceptable sense of enclosure together with harm to the outlook and living conditions of the adjoining occupiers. The proposal would therefore fail to comply with&nbsp;Policy 53 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024) and&nbsp;the neighbourliness and design principles of the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2010)."
  ],
